#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:95
msgid "Synchronise"
msgstr "Synchroniser"

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:100 includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:126
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Retour"

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:101 includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:128
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Continuer"

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:105
msgid "Import your order history"
msgstr "Importez votre historique de commandes"

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:106
msgid "Past orders give Injellik a head start: \"bought together\" recommendations are available after the next training instead of after weeks of tracking. Customers are identified by an anonymous hash, no personal data is sent. Imported orders are not counted in your subscription."
msgstr "Les commandes passées donnent une longueur d'avance à Injellik : les recommandations « achetés ensemble » sont disponibles dès le prochain entraînement, sans attendre des semaines de suivi. Les clients sont identifiés par une empreinte anonyme, aucune donnée personnelle n'est envoyée. Les commandes importées ne sont pas décomptées de votre abonnement."

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:110 includes/admin/views/settings.php:85
msgid "Orders placed since"
msgstr "Commandes passées depuis le"

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:113
msgid "%d paid order in total"
msgid_plural "%d paid orders in total"
msgstr[0] "%d commande payée au total"
msgstr[1] "%d commandes payées au total"

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:119 includes/admin/views/settings.php:81
msgid "Last import: %s"
msgstr "Dernier import : %s"

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:122 includes/admin/views/settings.php:90
msgid "Import the orders"
msgstr "Importer les commandes"

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:127
msgid "Skip this step"
msgstr "Passer cette étape"

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:132
msgid "Choose where to display recommendations"
msgstr "Choisissez où afficher les recommandations"

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:133
msgid "Enable the blocks you want. Each block uses a strategy, and a fallback strategy while Injellik is still learning. You can change everything later."
msgstr "Activez les blocs souhaités. Chaque bloc utilise une stratégie, et une stratégie de repli tant qu'Injellik apprend encore. Vous pourrez tout modifier plus tard."

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:139
msgid "Injellik is ready"
msgstr "Injellik est prêt"

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:140
msgid "Tracking is active. Recommendations based on behaviour appear after the next nightly training; until then the blocks use the fallback strategy."
msgstr "Le suivi est actif. Les recommandations fondées sur le comportement apparaissent après le prochain entraînement nocturne ; d'ici là, les blocs utilisent leur stratégie de repli."

#: includes/admin/views/onboarding.php:147
msgid "WP-Cron retries the events that could not be sent and synchronises the catalog every night. If WP-Cron is disabled on your server, schedule the URL shown in Settings > Data."
msgstr "WP-Cron renvoie les événements qui n'ont pas pu partir et synchronise le catalogue chaque nuit. Si WP-Cron est désactivé sur votre serveur, planifiez l'URL indiquée dans Réglages > Données."

